  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 801.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to all compensatory mitigation proposals required by Env-Wt 313.04 and for proposals that are eligible under RSA 482-A:29, I, for funding from the Aquatic Resource Compensatory Mitigation fund (“ARM Fund”).\n\nSource. #8062, eff 3-13-04; ss by #8341, eff 4-25-05 (See Revision Note at chapter heading of Env-Wt 800); ss by #8762, INTERIM, eff 11-21-06, EXPIRED: 5-20-07\n\nNew. #8911, eff 6-20-07; ss by #11000, eff 2-1-16; ss by #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800); ss by #13774, eff 10-13-23",
